{"name":"Fashionista","hex":"#66616f","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"fashionista","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A person who creates or promotes high fashion, i.e. a fashion designer or fashion editor.","A person who dresses according to the trends of fashion, or one who closely follows those trends."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/fashionista"}],"entries":[{"title":"Fashionistas (film)","blocks":[{"text":"The Fashionistas is a 2002 pornographic film directed by John Stagliano and produced by Evil Angel Productions. Shot on 35 mm film, it was a high-budget production, with a length of over four and a half hours. The film was a commercial success, selling over 100,000 copies just in its first month of release. In 2003, it set the record for most AVN Award nominations for a single title — 22."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/f/ff/The_Fashionistas_DVD_Cover_Art.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fashionistas_(film)"},{"title":"Fashionista (website)","blocks":[{"text":"Fashionista is a fashion website owned by Breaking Media."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fashionista_(website)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/f/ff/The_Fashionistas_DVD_Cover_Art.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/f/ff/The_Fashionistas_DVD_Cover_Art.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AThe_Fashionistas_DVD_Cover_Art.jpg"}],"sounds":{"fashionista":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c3/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-fashionista.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia